  "description": "Calculate the state of prison cells after N days, where a cell becomes 1 if its neighbors were both 1 or both 0, otherwise 0.",
  "target": 7,
  "pseudocode": "1. seen = map()\n2. for i = 0 to N-1:\n3.   if cells in seen: return seen[N % i]\n4.   seen[i] = cells.copy()\n5.   new_cells = [0] * 8\n6.   for j = 1 to 6: new_cells[j] = cells[j-1] == cells[j+1] ? 1 : 0\n7.   cells = new_cells\n8. return cells",
